            "typeName": "dataSources",
            "multiple": true,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": [
              "The source of this data is the r/StopGaming subreddit, accessible through its publicly available API. It relies on real-time interactions and submissions from users within the online community.  The selection procedure involves collecting data from all posts and comments on the subreddit, making it a comprehensive dataset rather than a sample."
            ]
